OL,3,GNEWSAHow EpiPen saved pupil's life as
OL,4,Anew rules introduced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student says she might have died had
OL,7,Fher school not had access to an EpiPen
OL,8,Fafter she ate a flapjack containing
OL,9,Fnuts she had an allergic reaction to.
OL,11,FMorgan Penny, from Bristol, said within
OL,12,F"a matter of minutes" she was "on the
OL,13,Ffloor, unconscious, not breathing".
OL,14,FWithout access to the pen, she says she
OL,15,F"probably would have died".
OL,17,FNew measures, which come into effect
OL,18,Ffrom September, will require English
OL,19,Fschools to maintain a stock of
OL,20,Fadrenaline pens in order to limit the
OL,21,Fimpact of a severe allergic reaction on
OL,22,Fschool premises.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
